Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7944766Z 
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7945245Z The real tool stops cooperatively only on SIGINT, so the helper timeout
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7946225Z now interrupts the tool first and kills it after the stop allowance,
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7947170Z keeping the timeout classification and every budget constant. The
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7948277Z finalizer re-reads the receipt after stopping a muxer-orphaned tool and
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7949505Z takes the exact down when one appeared. A missing or unexecutable tool
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7950690Z at finalization is recorded as unverified cleanup and still retains
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7951835Z declared diagnostics. A timed-out down no longer waits on a descendant
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7952804Z outside its process group, and camel-case secret keys are redacted.
