Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7953800Z The tests now model a tool that dies on SIGTERM. They add a timeout run
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7954720Z with a muxer, tool and tagged AppHost, an orphaned-tool finalizer run,
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7955888Z an owned AppHost descendant, a failed final cleanup record, a detached
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7956893Z down descendant, the exact derived timeout and budget refusal text. The
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7957884Z validator checks that the job's first step records its start, and the
Release	Create Release	2026-11-09T15:11:46.7958669Z documentation is corrected.
